  "prefLabel": "Stra 1102.01 Purpose and Scope of Program",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-07-02",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Stra 1102.01 Purpose and Scope of Program. The governor’s scholarship program is designed to provide financial assistance to eligible high school graduates or recent high school graduates who meet the definition of eligible student set forth in Stra 1101.07 to attend a postsecondary educational or training program of their choice within the state of New Hampshire. A recent high school graduate shall meet the requirements listed in Stra 1102.02 (d). The program shall provide scholarships which a recipient shall apply to the direct costs of an education at a participating postsecondary institution.\n\nSource. #12446, INTERIM, eff 1-3-18, EXPIRES: 7-2-18; ss by #12550, eff 6-19-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/stra1100.html"
